<div class="container py-5 mailbox-connect"><h1>Privacy at Nestly</h1>
  <p>Nestly stores your account, search ZIP and radius, saved communities, and listings you create. Searches send your ZIP to Zippopotam.us and the approximate search center and radius to an OpenStreetMap Overpass provider.</p>
  <h2 class="h4">Your Gmail connection</h2><p>Connecting Gmail is optional. Google grants Nestly read and send access. Nestly uses this access only to send the apartment inquiries you submit and display their replies. It does not scan or import your other conversations. Email bodies are fetched when you open a conversation and are not stored in Nestly's database.</p>
  <p>OAuth tokens are encrypted at rest. Nestly stores the connected address, inquiry recipients, subjects, Gmail thread identifiers, and delivery status. Email content is rendered as text; remote tracking images and attachments are not loaded.</p>
  <p>Disconnect Gmail from the Inbox page to remove the saved connection and its local conversation records. Your messages remain in Gmail. You can also revoke Nestly's access in your Google Account permissions.</p>
  <p>Nestly does not sell Google user data or use it for advertising or AI model training. Its use and transfer of information received from Google APIs adheres to the <%= link_to 'Google API Services User Data Policy', 'https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy', rel: 'noopener', target: '_blank' %>, including the Limited Use requirements.</p>
  <p>Account deletion removes your saved searches, favorites, connected mailbox, local conversations, and manually published properties. Map data shared between users remains attributed to OpenStreetMap contributors.</p>
  <p>This development instance is not a public rental service. Before public launch, the operator must publish their identity, contact information, and production retention policy.</p>
</div>
